[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/Event-Horizon@1bbb7d6eb2220ece884a36a3a4cf159395e168ac/docs/img/hero.jpg[/img][/center]

[center][size=4][b]A Vortex extension that installs a collection exactly as its curator built it — every archive checked by hash, the load order pinned — and then keeps it that way.[/b][/size][/center]

[center]
